menu "Classic shell (经典系统)"

config CS_SHELL_ENABLE
    bool "Boot into the classic system shell (lock, home, apps)"
    depends on RG_APP_ENABLE
    default y
    help
        Early-2010s style phone shell: lock screen, home grid, settings with
        Wi-Fi / SNTP / MQTT, pomodoro, weather and the call app. Release
        guidance runs inside it as the 释放 app. Disable to boot straight into
        release guidance as before.

config CS_COMPANION_NAME
    string "Companion name"
    depends on CS_SHELL_ENABLE
    default "Claude"
    help
        Name of the agent on the other end of the MQTT link, shown in the
        status bar, the call and Messages screens, Settings, Mines, Bingo and
        the astro dice. Drawn at runtime, so changing it needs no asset
        regeneration. Keep it short (about 6 Latin letters fit the status bar;
        longer names are clipped there). Non-ASCII characters must be in GB2312
        to be covered by the bundled fonts.

endmenu

menu "Release Guidance (释放引导)"

config RG_APP_ENABLE
    bool "Boot into the Release Guidance app instead of the BSP test menu"
    default y
    help
        The derivative application replaces the baseline hardware-test menu.
        Disable to get the original BSP demo menu back.

config RG_FX_ENABLE
    bool "Animated sky (drifting clouds, twinkling stars, weather)"
    depends on RG_APP_ENABLE
    default y
    help
        One LVGL timer at 12.5 fps. Disable for a static sky if rendering
        load or power draw turns out too high on the device.

config RG_RAIN_DROPS
    int "Rain drops in the rain weather"
    depends on RG_FX_ENABLE
    range 0 32
    default 16
    help
        Rain is the most expensive weather. Each drop invalidates two small
        rectangles per frame; keep the total under LVGL's 32 invalid areas.

config RG_LEAVES
    int "Falling leaves in the leaves weather"
    depends on RG_FX_ENABLE
    range 0 6
    default 4

config RG_PAGE_FADE_MS
    int "Page fade-in time in ms (0 = direct cut)"
    depends on RG_APP_ENABLE
    range 0 0
    default 0
    help
        Disabled: a full-screen opa fade needs an ARGB layer that does not fit
        the LVGL pool. Kept only so old sdkconfig files still parse.

config RG_SOUND_VOLUME
    int "Key sound volume (0-100)"
    depends on RG_APP_ENABLE
    range 0 100
    default 60

endmenu
